# 🔘 Arduino UNO LED Control Using Push Button and INPUT_PULLUP

## **📌 Project Overview**

This project demonstrates how to control the built-in LED of an Arduino UNO using a push button and the internal pull-up resistor. The `INPUT_PULLUP` mode eliminates the need for an external pull-up resistor. The LED turns ON when the button is pressed and turns OFF when the button is released.

## **🎯 Objectives**

* Understand digital input and output pins.
* Learn push-button interfacing with Arduino UNO.
* Understand the `INPUT_PULLUP` mode.
* Control an LED based on button input.
* Gain practical knowledge of embedded systems programming.

